==English==

===Etymology===
Yoruba .Abagun is also found in Ethiopia. According to Webster Dictionary, it is a name of a fowl in Ethiopia

Abagun is a Yoruba name coined from the name Obagun (Oba Ogun) which mean "King Of War". The names change was a result of a migration from Ijebu Ode to Ikorodu by one of the Warrior Sons of the Clan.

